  The one case PyTorch genuinely cannot handle automatically today: arbitrary 2D sharding changes across meshes where one 
  destination shard requires data from multiple non-contiguous source shards on different GPUs. For the PP+TP use case
  (uniform shard along hidden dim), this never happens — the patterns are always simple all_gather or chunk, which        
  functional collectives handle perfectly.                                                                              

